1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,847
All caps on a school website.

2
00:00:03,131 --> 00:00:04,428
Looks like a detail.

3
00:00:04,478 --> 00:00:06,980
Now multiply it by a thousand schools.

4
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:16,564
Every school has the same duties: accessibility, data protection, security, and rules that keep changing.

5
00:00:17,046 --> 00:00:20,967
Most face them alone, with their own budget and their own contractor.

6
00:00:21,017 --> 00:00:23,171
So quality comes down to chance.

7
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:29,046
Cleverphant is shared digital infrastructure for schools.

8
00:00:29,133 --> 00:00:31,438
What people see is the website.

9
00:00:31,722 --> 00:00:38,496
Underneath is what keeps it right: compliance, training, support, and a network that connects every school.

10
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:45,962
Because every school runs on the same system, they all get the same benefits, and the same bugs.

11
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:48,576
But it takes just one school to notice.

12
00:00:48,626 --> 00:00:50,861
Fixed once, fixed for all.

13
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:55,062
Ideas travel the same way.

14
00:00:55,112 --> 00:00:57,533
A curious school leader brings a need.

15
00:00:57,748 --> 00:00:59,658
Their school becomes the pilot.

16
00:00:59,873 --> 00:01:03,826
When the data shows it works, it becomes the standard for every school.

17
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:08,048
And it works from the top, too.

18
00:01:08,205 --> 00:01:16,303
A municipality or a ministry publishes a new rule or a campaign once, and it appears on every school website at the same time.

19
00:01:18,650 --> 00:01:22,441
A small village school gets what a large city school gets.

20
00:01:22,725 --> 00:01:25,970
A family changing schools finds a familiar place.

21
00:01:26,359 --> 00:01:30,266
The foundation is shared; the face stays the school's own.

22
00:01:30,550 --> 00:01:31,579
Not identical.

23
00:01:31,629 --> 00:01:32,820
Equally good.

24
00:01:35,150 --> 00:01:36,923
Change starts with details.

25
00:01:36,973 --> 00:01:39,510
Being small is no excuse to look away.

26
00:01:39,794 --> 00:01:46,826
Stop writing in capitals, stop stretching text, stop hiding information in images, get cookie consent right.

27
00:01:46,876 --> 00:01:49,321
That's our Trojan elephant, in the good sense.

28
00:01:49,709 --> 00:01:57,854
Once it works everywhere, we go further: a document bank, whistleblower protection, bookings, and next, AI integrations.

29
00:01:58,138 --> 00:02:00,443
Because AI can't work in chaos.

30
00:02:02,650 --> 00:02:07,626
What works in one school works in a municipality, a region, a whole country.

31
00:02:08,014 --> 00:02:11,970
Schools can be added quickly, while costs grow far more slowly.

32
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:13,524
Not a promise of cheap.

33
00:02:14,005 --> 00:02:15,497
The logic of scale.

34
00:02:17,650 --> 00:02:20,085
We have walked this road for fifteen years.

35
00:02:20,135 --> 00:02:27,816
Hundreds of institutions, whole municipalities on one standard, with content audits, proven onboarding and a training platform.

36
00:02:28,030 --> 00:02:29,778
Built in a small country.

37
00:02:29,992 --> 00:02:31,275
Ready for yours.

38
00:02:31,559 --> 00:02:33,272
Let's talk about your region.
